# Material Flow Simulator layout
# POPUP n page colour title / POPUPTEXT n text
# PAGE name / LAYERS count active / LAYER n visible locked name / ON layer
# CELL x y kind conn dia dir open strength
# STOCK x y water oil fluff sand air% feed%
# BUCKET x y w h
# LABEL x y text   (\n = new line)
# LABEL2 kind x y colour box format caption   (kind text/date/time, \s = space)
# FRAME x y w h colour dashed fill carry title
# LINK x y colour page|popup n caption
# EQUIP kind x y w h state flip linkx linky level name
# ECELL x y kind conn dir pos npos sel on tripped p1 p2 tag ref src p3
MFLOW 2
NAME Pneumatic logic: AND / OR
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 The AND valve passes air only when both S1\nand S2 give it; the shuttle valve passes\nwhichever of S3 / S4 does.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Switch S1 and S2: only both move A.\nSwitch S3 or S4: either moves B.

PAGE Plant
LAYERS 4 1
LAYER 1 1 0 Process
LAYER 2 1 0 Notes
LAYER 3 1 0 Equipment
LAYER 4 1 0 Pneumatic
GRAVITY 1.00
ON 1
ON 2
LABEL 24.00 90.00 PNEUMATIC LOGIC\nClick the 3/2 valves to switch them.\nA goes out only with S1 AND S2,\nB with S3 OR S4.
LINK 24.00 24.00 1 page 2 About
LINK 24.00 46.00 2 popup 1 How it works
LINK 24.00 68.00 3 popup 2 Try this
ON 3
EQUIP cylinder 120.00 220.00 56.00 240.00 stop 0 -1 -1 50.00 CylAND
EQUIP cylinder 300.00 220.00 56.00 240.00 stop 0 -1 -1 50.00 CylOR
EQUIP compressor 40.00 640.00 200.00 112.00 stop 0 -1 -1 50.00 Comp01
ON 4
