LABEL 96.00 96.00 EXAMPLE 17 - PNEUMATIC LOGIC\nA two-pressure valve (AND) and a shuttle\nvalve (OR) combine manual 3/2 valves.
LABEL 96.00 240.00 HOW THIS LAYOUT IS BUILT\nPage 1 "Plant" - the working process:\n  layer 1 "Process": pipes, feeders, buckets\n  layer 2 "Notes":   labels, frames, links\nPage 2 "About" - this page.\nFrame popups: "How it works", "Try this".
LABEL 96.00 408.00 GETTING AROUND\nClick a link button (Select tool) to jump.\nPgUp / PgDn, or < > in the menu bar.\nPage & Layer panel (F6): pages and layers.\nFrame popup panel (F7): edit the popups.
